# Converter environment for Core A GGUF production (decision 004 / 008), Mac arm64 only.
# Same pins as third_party/llama.cpp/requirements/requirements-convert_hf_to_gguf.txt
# (+ requirements-convert_legacy_llama.txt) at llama.cpp 7fe450e1, except the
# `--extra-index-url .../whl/cpu`: that index serves Linux CPU-only torch builds; on
# macOS arm64 torch comes from PyPI. The local gguf-py in the llama.cpp checkout is
# used by convert_hf_to_gguf.py (sys.path), not the PyPI gguf below.
